<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ko"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="450222547"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1191236799"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="With ELVIS"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="AOA"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ANGEL`S KNOCK"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:34.933"><div begin="00:05.418" end="03:14.718"><p begin="00:05.418" end="00:09.008" itunes:key="L1">쉽게 잠이 오질 않아<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睡不着</span></p><p begin="00:09.295" end="00:14.079" itunes:key="L2">내게도 아침이 오긴 하는 걸까<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清晨会</span></p><p begin="00:14.959" end="00:20.113" itunes:key="L3">혼자인 것 같아 고갤 떨군 순간<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我似乎是一个人</span></p><p begin="00:20.457" end="00:24.319" itunes:key="L4">맞닿아있던 네 어깨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却触碰到你的肩膀</span></p><p begin="00:25.740" end="00:29.118" itunes:key="L5">언제부터였던 걸까<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从何时开始</span></p><p begin="00:29.416" end="00:34.533" itunes:key="L6">나의 곁에 서 있었던 네 그림자<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的身边 有了你的影子</span></p><p begin="00:35.011" end="00:40.505" itunes:key="L7">초라했던 내 맘 무너지던 순간<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我焦急的心一蹶不振时</span></p><p begin="00:40.816" end="00:45.079" itunes:key="L8">날 향해 웃어준 네게<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对着我笑</span></p><p begin="00:45.119" end="00:50.657" itunes:key="L9">Remember 내 곁에서 기대도 돼요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记住 你可以在我身边</span></p><p begin="00:50.777" end="00:54.886" itunes:key="L10">내 작은 어깰 비워둘게<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我小小的肩膀为你保留</span></p><p begin="00:55.287" end="01:00.641" itunes:key="L11">Remember 약속할게 늘 지금처럼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记住 我们说好</span></p><p begin="01:00.885" end="01:05.017" itunes:key="L12">변함없이 그대로<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远不要变</span></p><p begin="01:05.445" end="01:10.839" itunes:key="L13">Remember 내 곁에서 울어도 돼요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记住 你可以在我身边</span></p><p begin="01:11.169" end="01:14.984" itunes:key="L14">언제나 지켜준 널 위해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一直守护你</span></p><p begin="01:15.450" end="01:20.894" itunes:key="L15">오늘도 변함없이 널 떠올리며<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天又想起你</span></p><p begin="01:21.209" end="01:25.244" itunes:key="L16">행복하게 노래해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我幸福地歌唱</span></p><p begin="01:26.325" end="01:29.824" itunes:key="L17">그대에게 다가갈게<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我向你靠近</span></p><p begin="01:30.050" end="01:35.133" itunes:key="L18">내가 지치고 힘들어 아플 때도<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我疲惫艰难痛苦时</span></p><p begin="01:35.644" end="01:41.028" itunes:key="L19">언제나 그대는 나를 감싸주죠<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总是会拥抱我</span></p><p begin="01:41.368" end="01:49.701" itunes:key="L20">난 그대 땜에 웃어요 With you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你 我才能欢笑 和你在一起</span></p><p begin="01:47.131" end="01:49.409" itunes:key="L21">오늘도 그대 생각에<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天又因为想你</span></p><p begin="01:49.522" end="01:51.801" itunes:key="L22">쉽게 잠들지 못하네<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而失眠</span></p><p begin="01:52.065" end="01:53.983" itunes:key="L23">우리 함께 보낸 시간<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们约定</span></p><p begin="01:54.035" end="01:56.914" itunes:key="L24">모두 다  잊지 않기로 약속해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将永不忘记</span></p><p begin="01:57.230" end="01:59.531" itunes:key="L25">말하지 않아도 느낄 수 있어<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使不说 也能感觉到</span></p><p begin="01:59.666" end="02:01.816" itunes:key="L26">언제나 우리 함께라는 것<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一直一直在一起</span></p><p begin="02:02.173" end="02:04.895" itunes:key="L27">내 곁엔 네가 네 곁엔 내가<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我身边有你</span></p><p begin="02:04.982" end="02:06.163" itunes:key="L28">흐흠 사랑해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我爱你</span></p><p begin="02:06.158" end="02:11.609" itunes:key="L29">Remember 내 곁에서 기대도 돼요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记住 你可以在我身边</span></p><p begin="02:11.868" end="02:16.005" itunes:key="L30">내 작은 어깰 비워둘게<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我小小的肩膀为你保留</span></p><p begin="02:16.250" end="02:21.760" itunes:key="L31">Remember 약속할게 늘 지금처럼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记住 我们说好</span></p><p begin="02:21.883" end="02:26.010" itunes:key="L32">변함없이 그대로<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永远不要变</span></p><p begin="02:26.296" end="02:31.921" itunes:key="L33">Remember 내 곁에서 울어도 돼요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">记住 你可以在我身边</span></p><p begin="02:31.994" end="02:35.870" itunes:key="L34">언제나 지켜준 널 위해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一直守护你</span></p><p begin="02:36.387" end="02:41.966" itunes:key="L35">오늘도 변함없이 널 떠올리며<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天又想起你</span></p><p begin="02:42.030" end="02:46.292" itunes:key="L36">행복하게 노래해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我幸福地歌唱</span></p><p begin="02:47.150" end="02:50.621" itunes:key="L37">행복했던 추억 모두<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有幸福的回忆</span></p><p begin="02:50.814" end="02:55.637" itunes:key="L38">우리 함께 힘들었던 기억 모두<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有艰难的记忆 都因你我一同度过</span></p><p begin="02:56.592" end="03:02.147" itunes:key="L39">특별해요 우린 남은 시간 서로<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而与众不同 希望我们剩余的时光</span></p><p begin="03:02.181" end="03:14.718" itunes:key="L40">소중한 추억이 되길 With you, whoa<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能成为彼此珍贵的回忆 和你在一起</span></p></div></body></tt>